# Secrets
.env
# Next.js reads .env.local and .env.<mode>.local automatically, so they are
# where a dashboard credential naturally ends up. Only `.env` was ignored,
# which meant PUBLIC_READ_API_KEY in apps/dashboard/.env.local was one
# `git add -A` from being committed.
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

